<div class="news-scroll">
  <div class="news-list">
    <strong>学术服务：</strong>担任 ICSE 2026、FSE 2026、ISSTA 2026 等国际会议程序委员会委员。
    <br>
    *2026/09.* <strong>大模型智能体：</strong>四项新工作分别研究<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.04167" target="_blank">面向代码评审约束的智能体评测</a>、<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.01603" target="_blank">轨迹感知的高效评测</a>、<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27449" target="_blank">高质量训练轨迹选择</a>与<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.18859" target="_blank">修复策略探索</a>。
    <br>
    *2026/09.* <strong>仓库级代码生成：</strong>新工作 <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.01601" target="_blank">ACToR</a> 提出自适应关键 token 感知检索方法。
    <br>
    *2026/09.* <strong>智能代码评审：</strong><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27442" target="_blank">MCR-Bench</a> 面向真实世界多轮代码评审开展动态评测，已被 ISSTA 2026 录用。
    <br>
    *2026/07.* <strong>智能体与仓库级推理：</strong>关于<a href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3797119" target="_blank">智能体数据自动构建</a>和<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.25996" target="_blank">仓库级代码推理</a>的两项工作发表于 FSE 2026。
    <br>
    *2026/07.* <strong>代码大模型：</strong>四项 ACL 2026 工作研究<a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1189/" target="_blank">高效长代码补全</a>、<a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.findings-acl.969/" target="_blank">面向鸿蒙的仓库级代码补全</a>、<a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.findings-acl.1786/" target="_blank">安全代码生成</a>与<a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.findings-acl.1877/" target="_blank">开发知识评测</a>。
    <br>
    *2026/04.* <strong>Repository-Level Code Generation &amp; Testing:</strong> Three works at ICSE 2026 investigate <a href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/icse-2026/icse-2026-research-track/182/What-to-Retrieve-for-Effective-Retrieval-Augmented-Code-Generation-An-Empirical-Stud" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">effective retrieval for code generation</a>, <a href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/icse-2026/icse-2026-research-track/229/Top-General-Performance-Top-Domain-Performance-DomainCodeBench-A-Multi-domain-Cod" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">multi-domain code generation evaluation</a>, and <a href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/icse-2026/icse-2026-research-track/241/Knowledge-Matters-Injecting-Project-and-Testing-Knowledge-into-LLM-based-Unit-Test-G" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">knowledge-enhanced unit test generation</a>.
    <br>
    *2025/12.* <strong>Code Intelligence:</strong> Our 2025 journal publications cover LLM-based code quality evaluation (CodeCritic), test-driven code search (CoSQA+), <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.17744" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">full-repository code translation</a>, and the <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2409.09030" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">landscape of software engineering agents</a>.
    <br>
    *2025/11.* <strong>Repository-Level Code Intelligence:</strong> Three works at ASE 2025 explore <a href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/ase-2025/ase-2025-papers/34/AlignCoder-Aligning-Retrieval-with-Target-Intent-for-Repository-Level-Code-Completio" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">intent-aligned retrieval</a>, <a href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/ase-2025/ase-2025-papers/149/DrainCode-Stealthy-Energy-Consumption-Attacks-on-Retrieval-Augmented-Code-Generation" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">context-poisoning energy attacks</a>, and <a href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/ase-2025/ase-2025-papers/143/RustRepoTrans-Repository-level-Context-Code-Translation-Benchmark-Targeting-Rust" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">repository-level translation to Rust</a>.
    <br>
    *2025/06.* <strong>Software Agents &amp; Code Reliability:</strong> Our ISSTA/FSE 2025 work examines <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.04606" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">multilingual and multimodal issue resolution</a>, <a href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/issta-2025/issta-2025-papers/22/LLM-Hallucinations-in-Practical-Code-Generation-Phenomena-Mechanism-and-Mitigation" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">hallucinations in practical code generation</a>, and <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.00456" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">coding-style inconsistencies beyond functional correctness</a>.
    <br>
    *2025/04.* <strong>Code Intelligence:</strong> We released a <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.08734" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">systematic study of context utilization</a>, and our work on <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.19444" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">rebuilding code pre-training data with LLMs</a> received an ACM SIGSOFT Distinguished Paper Award at ICPC 2025.
    <br>
    *2024/12.* <strong>Software Agents &amp; Code Translation:</strong> <a href="https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2024/hash/5d1f02132ef51602adf07000ca5b6138-Abstract-Conference.html" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">MAGIS</a> appeared at NeurIPS 2024, and we released <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.17744" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;">RepoTransBench</a> for real-world repository-level code translation.
